('helping-a-perfectionist-child-relax-made-easy', 'Helping a Perfectionist Child Relax, Made Easy', 'Most families don''t struggle with helping a perfectionist child relax because they''re doing it wrong — they struggle because nobody handed them a system. What follows is the approa', 'The Bubaly Team', '2026-05-20', 3, ARRAY['#bubaly','#familylife','#parenting','#helpingperfectionist','#lifehacks','#parentinghacks']::text[], 'Parenting', false, '#7c5dff', 'https://loremflickr.com/1600/900/family,children,parenting?lock=1050', 'A photo related to helping a perfectionist child relax.', 'LoremFlickr (CC)', $json$[{"type":"p","text":"Most families don't struggle with helping a perfectionist child relax because they're doing it wrong — they struggle because nobody handed them a system."},{"type":"p","text":"What follows is the approach we keep coming back to: simple enough to start this week, flexible enough to survive a bad Tuesday."},{"type":"h2","text":"Model the repair, not just the rule"},{"type":"p","text":"Kids do as we do far more than as we say. If you want calm, be calm out loud: \"I'm taking a breath because I'm frustrated\" is a masterclass they'll remember."},{"type":"h2","text":"Connection before correction"},{"type":"p","text":"Behavior is communication. A ten-second reconnect — eye level, a hand on the shoulder, a real question — resolves more than a raised voice ever will, and it costs almost nothing."},{"type":"h2","text":"Lower the bar on purpose"},{"type":"p","text":"Perfectionism is the enemy of a warm home. A \"good enough\" dinner eaten together beats a Pinterest meal served to a stressed-out table."},{"type":"h2","text":"Give the choice, keep the frame"},{"type":"p","text":"\"Bath now or after this show?\" beats \"Go take a bath.\" The child gets agency; you keep the outcome. It's the oldest trick in the parenting book because it works."},{"type":"h2","text":"A simple place to start"},{"type":"p","text":"First, add a gentle reminder so nobody has to hold it in their head. Next, put it somewhere the whole family can see it. Then, agree on who owns it so it isn't quietly one person's job."},{"type":"h2","text":"Where Bubaly fits in"},{"type":"p","text":"Want helping a perfectionist child relax to run itself? That's what Bubaly does — one calm home for your family's schedule, tasks, meals, and money, with AI that stays a step ahead. Start at bubaly.com."},{"type":"p","text":"None of this has to be perfect. Pick one idea, try it for a week, and keep only what earns its place."}]$json$::jsonb, true),
('a-simple-system-for-raising-kids-across-a-big-age-gap', 'A Simple System for Raising Kids Across a Big Age Gap', 'Ask ten parents about raising kids across a big age gap and you''ll get ten answers, forty opinions, and one shared sigh. We''ll walk through what actually moves the needle, what to ', 'Sofia Alvarez', '2026-06-08', 3, ARRAY['#bubaly','#familylife','#parenting','#raisingkids','#worklifebalance']::text[], 'Parenting', false, '#7c5dff', 'https://loremflickr.com/1600/900/family,children,parenting?lock=1051', 'A photo related to raising kids across a big age gap.', 'LoremFlickr (CC)', $json$[{"type":"p","text":"Ask ten parents about raising kids across a big age gap and you'll get ten answers, forty opinions, and one shared sigh."},{"type":"p","text":"We'll walk through what actually moves the needle, what to skip, and how to make it feel less like a chore and more like a shared routine."},{"type":"h2","text":"Model the repair, not just the rule"},{"type":"p","text":"Kids do as we do far more than as we say. If you want calm, be calm out loud: \"I'm taking a breath because I'm frustrated\" is a masterclass they'll remember."},{"type":"h2","text":"Connection before correction"},{"type":"p","text":"Behavior is communication. A ten-second reconnect — eye level, a hand on the shoulder, a real question — resolves more than a raised voice ever will, and it costs almost nothing."},{"type":"h2","text":"One-on-one beats the group"},{"type":"p","text":"Even a quick errand run solo with one child fills a cup that group time can't reach. Rotate who gets the passenger seat and watch the rivalry cool."},{"type":"h2","text":"Fewer, firmer boundaries"},{"type":"p","text":"Households run smoother with a handful of non-negotiables held kindly than with fifty rules enforced at random. Decide the few that matter, say them once, and let natural consequences do the teaching."},{"type":"h2","text":"Consistency over intensity"},{"type":"p","text":"A quiet rule kept every day outp