('navigating-group-project-drama-that-actually-sticks', 'Navigating Group-project Drama That Actually Sticks', 'Nobody puts navigating group-project drama on their vision board, and yet it shapes the temperature of the whole house. What follows is the approach we keep coming back to: simple ', 'Sofia Alvarez', '2025-01-29', 3, ARRAY['#bubaly','#familylife','#schoollife','#navigatinggroupproject','#worklifebalance','#homelife']::text[], 'School & Activities', false, '#10b981', 'https://loremflickr.com/1600/900/school,classroom,students?lock=1181', 'A photo related to navigating group-project drama.', 'LoremFlickr (CC)', $json$[{"type":"p","text":"Nobody puts navigating group-project drama on their vision board, and yet it shapes the temperature of the whole house."},{"type":"p","text":"What follows is the approach we keep coming back to: simple enough to start this week, flexible enough to survive a bad Tuesday."},{"type":"h2","text":"Build a launch-and-land routine"},{"type":"p","text":"The first ten minutes home and the last ten before bed set the tone for school. Predictable bookends make the chaotic middle much easier to steer."},{"type":"h2","text":"Talk to the teacher early"},{"type":"p","text":"A friendly note in week two beats a tense meeting in month three. Teachers are allies; the earlier you're on the same page, the smaller every problem stays."},{"type":"h2","text":"Protect the sleep, guard the mornings"},{"type":"p","text":"Nearly every school-morning battle traces back to bedtime the night before. Win the evening and the morning mostly wins itself."},{"type":"h2","text":"Don't do the homework"},{"type":"p","text":"The goal is a capable kid, not a finished worksheet. \"Quiz me,\" \"explain it back,\" and \"where are you stuck?\" build skills; taking over builds dependence."},{"type":"h2","text":"The one folder rule"},{"type":"p","text":"Every school paper goes in exactly one place the moment it enters the house. Half of school stress is really paper-mana