('everything-families-get-wrong-about-keeping-grandparents-connected-with-tech', 'Everything Families Get Wrong About Keeping Grandparents Connected with Tech', 'Keeping Grandparents Connected with Tech is one of those quietly relentless parts of family life: never urgent enough to fix, never small enough to ignore. We''ll walk through what ', 'The Bubaly Team', '2026-03-19', 3, ARRAY['#bubaly','#familylife','#familytech','#keepinggrandparents','#parentinghacks','#familyfirst']::text[], 'AI & Technology', false, '#6366f1', 'https://loremflickr.com/1600/900/technology,child,tablet?lock=1258', 'A photo related to keeping grandparents connected with tech.', 'LoremFlickr (CC)', $json$[{"type":"p","text":"Keeping Grandparents Connected with Tech is one of those quietly relentless parts of family life: never urgent enough to fix, never small enough to ignore."},{"type":"p","text":"We'll walk through what actually moves the needle, what to skip, and how to make it feel less like a chore and more like a shared routine."},{"type":"h2","text":"The proactive front door"},{"type":"p","text":"You have to go to a chatbot. The useful version comes to you: here are three things that need a decision, two that were handled, and one that becomes a problem Friday. Ten minutes of foresight beats an hour of scrambling."},{"type":"h2","text":"Screens with intention"},{"type":"p","text":"The problem was never screens; it's aimless screens. Tools that default to a plan — homework help that doesn't do the homework, timers that end gently — turn a fight into a feature."},{"type":"h2","text":"A family knowledge base"},{"type":"p","text":"Shoe sizes, the pediatrician's number, who's allergic to what. None of it is hard; there's just an enormous amount of it. A system that answers in plain language is worth more than any single flashy feature."},{"type":"h2","text":"Ask better questions"},{"type":"p","text":"AI rewards specificity. \"Plan three 20-minute dinners for a nut-free week using what's 