('the-family-playbook-for-stress-free-holiday-cooking', 'The Family Playbook for Stress-free Holiday Cooking', 'Most families don''t struggle with stress-free holiday cooking because they''re doing it wrong — they struggle because nobody handed them a system. Below is a calm, practical way to ', 'Sofia Alvarez', '2025-04-29', 3, ARRAY['#bubaly','#familylife','#familymeals','#stressfreeholiday','#familyfirst','#organizedhome']::text[], 'Recipes & Food', false, '#f97316', 'https://loremflickr.com/1600/900/cooking,kitchen,food?lock=1398', 'A photo related to stress-free holiday cooking.', 'LoremFlickr (CC)', $json$[{"type":"p","text":"Most families don't struggle with stress-free holiday cooking because they're doing it wrong — they struggle because nobody handed them a system."},{"type":"p","text":"Below is a calm, practical way to think about it — not a rigid program, just a handful of ideas you can borrow tonight and adjust for your own family."},{"type":"h2","text":"Embrace the theme night"},{"type":"p","text":"Taco Tuesday, breakfast-for-dinner, pasta night — themes kill the daily \"what's for dinner\" decision while leaving room to vary the details. Structure with flexibility is the whole game."},{"type":"h2","text":"Plan around the week you actually have"},{"type":"p","text":"The best dinner plan bends to reality: fast meals on busy nights, the ambitious one on a night you're home. Matching stress-free holiday cooking to the real calendar is why plans survive past Wednesday."},{"type":"h2","text":"Keep a short list of house dinners"},{"type":"p","text":"Every family needs ten reliable, everyone-eats-it meals on rotation. It's not boring; it's a foundation. Save the experiments for the weekend and let weeknights be easy."},{"type":"h2","text":"Lower the stakes on dinner"},{"type":"p","text":"A simple meal eaten together beats an elaborate one served to a stressed table. The nutrition of connection is real; give yourself permission to keep it easy."},{"type":"h2",